{"type":"standard","title":"Stacy Garrity","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Stacy Garrity</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q101445738","titles":{"canonical":"Stacy_Garrity","normalized":"Stacy Garrity","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Stacy Garrity</span></span>"},"pageid":65811401,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fb/Stacy_Garrity%2C_2025_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Stacy_Garrity%2C_2025_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":439},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fb/Stacy_Garrity%2C_2025_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":368,"height":490},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1377665958","tid":"dc44282f-bccc-11f1-9b21-09b6b90cf392","timestamp":"2026-09-30T12:45:48Z","description":"American politician and businesswoman (born 1964)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stacy_Garrity","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stacy_Garrity?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stacy_Garrity?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Stacy_Garrity"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stacy_Garrity","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Stacy_Garrity","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stacy_Garrity?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Stacy_Garrity"}},"extract":"Stacy L. Garrity is an American politician, businesswoman, and former United States Army Reserve officer who has served as the 79th treasurer of Pennsylvania since 2021. A Republican, she defeated incumbent Democrat Joe Torsella in 2020 despite being outraised and trailing in polls. She won reelection in 2024, defeating Democratic challenger Erin McClelland with 51.9% of the vote.","extract_html":"<p><b>Stacy L. Garrity</b> is an American politician, businesswoman, and former United States Army Reserve officer who has served as the 79th treasurer of Pennsylvania since 2021. A Republican, she defeated incumbent Democrat Joe Torsella in 2020 despite being outraised and trailing in polls. She won reelection in 2024, defeating Democratic challenger Erin McClelland with 51.9% of the vote.</p>"}